  "experiment": "native_compressed_ordered_navigation_v1",
  "scope": "Sequential local Debug observations on a shared machine. No isolated causal latency, empty-cache, real-cloud or archive-scale throughput claim. No own E2E/build overlap during the final comparisons.",
  "cache_contract": "Three samples per wide/native case and cache mode. Five alternating warm samples for each projection after both field-count variants are primed. Process restart retains persistent/OS caches and readiness warming.",
